## Available dependencies

Native HTML, CSS, and browser DOM APIs are available. No external packages, React components, remote code, credentials, or configured network services are supplied. Implement browser behavior natively. Missing optional fonts, photos, copy, or destinations do not require an unavailable component conflict: use the draft policy above.

Online images: Desegnos can download public HTTPS PNG or JPEG images into this project. Request a download with an HTML img element bearing data-desegnos-download, a direct HTTPS src, and descriptive alt text. Use actual known image URLs or a URL supplied by the user; no invented search results. This is an image downloader, not web search. Prefer existing portable identity assets for logos. Include a visible credit and source link when known; never invent ownership or license permission. Do not use an online image as an authentic screenshot of this product or customer work. At most four distinct downloads, 256 KiB each, 4096 pixels per side and 8 million pixels, are attempted per generation. Failed, oversized, or unavailable images become visibly labelled image placeholders. The native adapter embeds accepted image bytes before application and export. Never use external srcset, CSS URLs, remote fonts, scripts, or a browser fetch as a download workaround.

